45        <!--
46             NIP-A3 payment targets. Android 11+ package visibility means
47             queryIntentActivities returns NOTHING for a scheme not declared here,
48             so without these the zap picker's pay-to chip is invisible on every
49             modern device. Specific <intent> filters rather than
50             QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES, which is policy-restricted on Play.
51             Unknown target types all fall back to payto://<type>/<authority>,
52             so the single payto entry covers the open-ended tail.
53             No <category>: a category here narrows visibility the same way it
54             narrows an intent match, and would hide any app whose filter declares
55             only DEFAULT - which is what our ACTION_VIEW hand-off actually uses.
56        -->
